# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT GETS UPLOADED TO THE DEPLOYMENT.
# outputDirectory is "." — the repo root IS the public site — so anything NOT
# listed here is served at https://contentshrimp.com/<path>. Every rule below
# was checked against app.html / index.html / sw.js / manifest.json / api/ for
# runtime references before being added (see scripts/verify/public-exposure.mjs,
# which fails loudly if a required public asset is ever excluded by mistake).
# DO NOT add a blanket *.js / *.json / *.png rule — that would delete api/*.js,
# package.json (used to install function deps) and every icon.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Editor backups / temp files
*.bak
*.orig
*.old
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.fuse_hidden*

# secrets stay local — Vercel uses its own env vars
.env
.env.*
.auth.json

# Internal engineering documentation. Every .md in this repo is working notes
# (CLAUDE.md is 692KB of architecture, known defects and infra detail). Verified:
# no .md file is linked or fetched by any public page, sw.js or api/ endpoint.
*.md

# Database schema + row-level-security policy source — never a public asset.
sql/
*.sql

# Build / verification tooling. Runs on the dev machine only; nothing at runtime
# references scripts/ (api/_build.js is generated INTO api/ and stays deployed).
scripts/
DEPLOY.command
*.sh

# Local QA/test harness + its output (this is also what blew past Vercel's 1GB limit)
node_modules/
mobile-shots/
mobile-test-shots/
qa-runs/
qa-*.png
*.webm
*.zip
mobile-test.js
mobile-user.js
mobile-shots.js
mobile-user*.json
qa.js
measure-consistency.js

# Renderer spike page — a standalone dev harness, deliberately never in the SW
# CORE list and referenced only from a code comment in app.html.
render-test.html

# Generated output of api/_publish/selftest.js (sample render PNGs, dev only)
_render-selftest/

# Tooling state / stray empty files — no public purpose
.git/
.vercel/
.unlazy/
.writetest
Faceless
